OL,3,GNEWSAUK and German governments plan to
OL,4,Ause Shetland spaceport
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK and German governments say they
OL,7,Fplan to use SaxaVord Spaceport in
OL,8,FShetland as part of increased
OL,9,Fcooperation between the two countries.
OL,11,FThe agreement follows a meeting between
OL,12,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham and
OL,13,FChancellor Friedrich Merz in Berlin
OL,14,Flast week.
OL,16,FIn a joint statement, the two
OL,17,Fgovernments said they would deepen
OL,18,Fstrategic cooperation on civil,
OL,19,Fcommercial, security and defence
OL,20,Finterests in space.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
