OL,3,GNEWSAUK and German governments plan to
OL,4,Ause Shetland spaceport
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaxaVord in Unst is the UK's first
OL,7,Ffully-licensed spaceport and has
OL,8,Fregulatory approval for up to 30 rocket
OL,9,Flaunches a year.
